%% Story 6.1 — Authenticated request path (with refresh-on-401)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as RN App (apiService)
    participant API as Express /api/v1
    participant OA as optionalAuth
    participant G as requireOrganizer (user-aware)
    participant H as mvpSessions handler
    participant DB as Prisma/Postgres

    App->>App: read accessToken from AsyncStorage
    App->>API: PUT /mvp-sessions/:shareCode (Bearer <access>, x-device-id)
    API->>OA: optionalAuth
    OA->>OA: verifyAccessToken(token)
    alt token valid
        OA->>DB: user.findUnique(id)
        DB-->>OA: user
        OA->>OA: req.user = { id, email, role }
        OA->>G: next()
    else token expired/invalid
        OA-->>App: 401 { error: { code: UNAUTHORIZED } }
        App->>API: POST /auth/refresh { refreshToken }
        API->>DB: refreshTokenService.isValid + rotate
        DB-->>API: ok (new pair)
        API-->>App: 200 { data: { tokens } }
        App->>App: persist new tokens
        App->>API: retry PUT /mvp-sessions/:shareCode (Bearer <new access>)
        API->>OA: optionalAuth (valid now)
        OA->>G: next()
    end
    G->>DB: find session by shareCode (+ players)
    DB-->>G: session (ownerUserId? / ownerDeviceId?)
    G->>G: resolveIdentity: JWT wins -> ownerUserId===req.user.id ? allow
    alt authorized
        G->>H: next()
        H->>DB: mutate session/player
        DB-->>H: updated
        H-->>App: 200 { success, data }
    else not authorized
        G-->>App: 403 { error: { code: FORBIDDEN } }
    end

%% Story 6.1 — Guest join path (token-free, no regression)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guest as Guest App (no token stored)
    participant API as Express /api/v1
    participant H as POST /mvp-sessions/join/:shareCode
    participant DB as Prisma/Postgres
    participant IO as Socket.io room

    Guest->>API: POST /mvp-sessions/join/:shareCode { name, deviceId }
    Note over API: NO auth middleware on this route (open by design)
    API->>H: route handler (unchanged)
    H->>DB: mvpSession.findUnique(shareCode)
    DB-->>H: session (ACTIVE?)
    H->>DB: mvpPlayer.create({ sessionId, name, deviceId })
    DB-->>H: player
    H->>IO: emit 'mvp-session-updated' + 'player_joined'
    H-->>Guest: 201 { success, data: { player } }
